-- ============================================================
-- PricePilot AI
-- Database Seed
-- ============================================================
--
-- The current PricePilot AI backend does not use a fixed
-- SQL seed dataset.
--
-- Product seed data is generated by:
--
-- pricepilot-backend/app/db/seed_products.py
--
-- That script:
--   1. Connects to the SQLite database.
--   2. Recreates the products table.
--   3. Fetches product data from DummyJSON.
--   4. Normalizes product categories.
--   5. Inserts the fetched products into the database.
--
-- Therefore, no hard-coded product records are duplicated here.
--
-- The application database schema is defined in:
--
-- database/schema.sql
--
-- ============================================================

PRAGMA foreign_keys = ON;

